\nTherefore, by the zero-product property, we have to solve two equations:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{tan}⁡x=0,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\sqrt{7}=0\n$$\n\nLet's solve each equation separately.\n\n- First, we solve $\\operatorname{tan}⁡x=0.$ The solutions to this equation for $0\\le x<2\\pi $ are $x=0,\\,\\pi .$\n\n- Then, we solve $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\sqrt{7}=0,$ or equivalently $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\sqrt{7}.$ But since $|\\operatorname{cos}⁡x|\\le 1,$ then $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\sqrt{7}$ has no solution.\n\nArranging all solutions from both equations in ascending order, we get\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}=0,\\,{x}_{2}=\\pi .\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186543470 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186110683 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b8553da6-42ce-5b77-97c4-7d9e2ee55f85" :knowledge-point/title "Solving a Trigonometric Equation by Rearranging the Equation and Then Factoring"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "12c635bd-4dab-5b49-9f10-53f8bdb5e07b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\pi" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186542686}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "12c635bd-4dab-5b49-9f10-53f8bdb5e07b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\pi" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186542686} :answer-field/id #uuid "9dafbda0-33c7-55d7-95af-3b84510f7137" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543400} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4c9ed5c3-470f-5713-9a8f-70c76e807b4d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186542847}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4c9ed5c3-470f-5713-9a8f-70c76e807b4d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186542847} :answer-field/id #uuid "a82f275d-a89c-55d9-9c